## Products & Services

- [Flights](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/flights): Search and book domestic and international flight tickets with over 80 airline partners and integrated "Smart Reschedule" features.
- [Hotels](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/hotel): Booking engine for over 500,000 accommodations worldwide, including luxury hotels, budget stays, and "Pay at Hotel" options.
- [Trains](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/kereta-api): Booking platform for KAI (Kereta Api Indonesia) intercity rail tickets, covering seat/class selection, passenger identity requirements, baggage policies, and post-purchase ticket adjustments.
- [To-Do](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/to-do): A lifestyle marketplace for attractions, theme parks, sightseeing tours, workshops, and travel essentials like SIM cards and WiFi rentals.
- [Villas & Apartments](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/homes): A dedicated booking service for private holiday rentals, apartments, and villas tailored for groups and long-term stays.
- [Car Rental](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/sewa-mobil): Booking service for self-drive and driver-included vehicle rentals across Indonesia, with area-based pricing packages and documentation requirements handled during checkout.
- [Airport Transfer](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/airport-transfer): Private shuttle booking service between airports or stations and selected destinations, with fixed-rate pricing, defined pickup/waiting windows, and flight-adjustment protocols for domestic and international travel.
- [Events](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/to-do/search?productAllCategoryCodes=EVENT): Official ticketing partner for major concerts, music festivals, sports events, and local entertainment activities.
- [Bus & Shuttle](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/bus-travel): Booking platform for inter-city bus and shuttle travel across multiple operators, with seat selection and IDR-based transactions.
- [Whoosh](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/kereta-api/kcic): High-speed railway booking platform for the Jakarta-Bandung route; tiket.com is the first OTA to sell Whoosh tickets, offering travel at speeds up to 350 km/h.

## Loyalty Program

tiket.com's loyalty system has three connected layers: Blibli Tiket Rewards is the umbrella program spanning the Blibli-Tiket-Ranch-Dekoruma ecosystem; Blibli Tiket Points is the earned currency that functions like cash at checkout; and Tiket Mission is a task-based layer where completing specific criteria (e.g. number of bookings, transaction value) earns points or vouchers.

- [Blibli Tiket Rewards](https://www.bliblitiketrewards.com/info): A unified loyalty program across the Blibli-Tiket-Ranch-Dekoruma ecosystem, allowing users to earn and spend points across different platforms.
- [Blibli Tiket Point](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/explore/blibli-tiket-points): The loyalty rewards currency earned from multiple sources (transactions, gamification, etc.) across the Blibli Tiket ecosystem. Points function like money and can be used to offset payment value during checkout.
- [Tiket Mission](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/explore/mission-center): A loyalty engagement feature where users complete tasks based on their tiket.com transactions. By enrolling in a mission and fulfilling its criteria (e.g. number of bookings, gross booking value), users earn rewards such as vouchers or points.

## Features and Benefits

- [Gift Cards](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/gift-card): Digital and physical prepaid cards that can be purchased and redeemed across tiket.com services. Digital cards are delivered via WhatsApp for instant gifting; physical cards suit offline or special-occasion use. Once redeemed, the value is converted into a voucher or balance stored in the user's account (Voucher Box) and applied at checkout.
- [tiket Multi-Insurance](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/info/flights-extra-protection): Travel protection offered by tiket.com. Users can add protection suited to their trip during booking, after booking, or to an existing order via the app or website.
- [Smart Reschedule & Refund](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/info/flight-100-percent-refund-reschedule): A self-service feature that lets users manage changes to their travel plans independently, directly through the tiket.com app or website.
- [Downpay](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/explore/tiket-downpayment): A feature that allows users to pay a fraction of the price upfront and settle the remainder before the departure date.
- [100% Refund](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/info/tiket-100-persen-refund): A feature allowing users to receive a full ticket price refund for cancellations made up to 24 hours before departure.

## Legal and Policy Information

- [Privacy Policy](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/info/privacy-policy): Detailed information on how user data is collected, protected, and utilized within the ecosystem.
- [Tiket Hotel Partner](https://tix.tiket.com/v3/): The Extranet portal (Web TIX) for hotel partners to log in, manage room inventory, set rates, and view booking performance.
- [Tiket Homes Partner](https://tix.tiket.com/v3/homes): The Extranet dashboard for partners managing Non-Hotel Accommodations (NHA) such as villas, apartments, and guest houses to manage their property listings.
- [Tiket Corporate](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/corporate): A B2B solution offering travel management services for companies, enabling simplified booking for employee business trips with special corporate rates and reporting tools.
- [Affiliate Program](https://www.tiket.com/id-id/affiliate): A partnership program allowing content creators, publishers, and influencers to earn commissions by promoting tiket.com products through trackable referral links.


